data: {"doc_id": "2eb01b1f3c4e", "url": "http://127.0.0.1:8097/article.html", "title": "Planning a small documentation release", "content": "# Planning a small documentation release\nA useful documentation release gives a new reader one clear way to start. Begin with the task the project solves, then show the command that runs its smallest example.\n## Release checklist\nCheck the installation steps in a clean environment. Capture output from a local example. State which integrations were tested and which still require credentials. Keep the source URL beside extracted content so a reader can trace the result.\nThis synthetic article is included only as an extraction fixture. It contains no customer data and needs no external service.", "word_count": 96, "scraped_at": "2026-09-22T07:29:36.508656+00:00", "scraper_used": "crawl4ai", "settings_used": {"scraper": "crawl4ai", "stealth_mode": false, "wait_for_js": false, "remove_links": true, "remove_images": true, "only_main_content": false}}
